## Global footprint steering committee

The committee should include:

- Operations;
- Engineering;
- Supply chain;
- Trade and customs;
- Finance;
- Quality;
- Legal and compliance;
- HR;
- Sales and customer service; and
- Country leadership.

It should approve:

